# Only what the build needs is sent to Docker. Everything else stays out of the build context,
# so it cannot end up in a layer by accident: build output (which can hold a 2 GB test list),
# tests and their fixtures, the development database scripts, local settings.
*
!pom.xml
!mvnw
!.mvn/
!src/
src/*
!src/main/
**/.env
**/*.env
